    description: one 4-connected mixed-color object containing source-color and marker-color cells
    bbox: 1-4 rows x 3-4 cols, area 4-8 cells [observed]
    source_cells: 3-6 forming an arbitrary connected shape
    marker_cells: 1-2, 4-connected to source cells so whole template is one 4-connected component
    no_overlap: source and marker cells occupy distinct positions within bbox; bbox may have holes
  target_squares:
